          "contentRef": "section:ttl:scenario",
          "kind": "scenario",
          "label": "情境",
          "text": "在故障處理期間，將 api.example.com 切換至新的負載平衡器。"
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:ttl:step:0",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步驟 1",
          "text": "確認目前的 TTL 與快取可能剩餘的時間。"
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:ttl:step:1",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步驟 2",
          "text": "決定切換標準以及舊目的地要維持多久。"
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 20,
      "id": "fundamentals.domain-dns:section:ttl:example:1",
      "kind": "example",
      "label": "具體範例",
      "objectiveIds": [
        "ttl"
      ],
      "sectionId": "ttl",
      "sources": [],
      "style": "normal",
      "unitId": "fundamentals.domain-dns",
      "position": 17,
      "remainingSteps": 22,
      "totalSteps": 39
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:ttl:step:2",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步驟 3",
          "text": "切換後，從多個解析器觀察回應和應用程式狀態。"
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:ttl:outcome",
          "kind": "outcome",
          "label": "結論",
          "text": "可以考量舊回應持續存在的時間，來設計切換和監控。"
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 18,
      "id": "fundamentals.domain-dns:section:ttl:example:2",
      "kind": "example",
