    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:paragraph:0",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "區分名稱解析故障與連線後的故障",
          "text": "DNS 會根據名稱傳回連線目標。能否與傳回的目標建立 TCP 連線、HTTP 是否傳回預期回應，以及 TLS 憑證是否與名稱相符，都是獨立的檢查。"
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:paragraph:1",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "區分名稱解析故障與連線後的故障",
          "text": "Route 53 運作狀態檢查和路由政策會影響 DNS 回應的選擇，但不能保證應用程式的所有功能都正常。請明確定義監控目標和切換條件。"
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:paragraph:2",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "區分名稱解析故障與連線後的故障",
          "text": "將公開 DNS、私有託管區域、負載平衡器、CloudFront 和憑證的擁有者繪製成圖，以判斷故障發生在哪一層。"
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 39,
      "id": "fundamentals.domain-dns:section:boundary:concept:1",
      "kind": "reading",
      "label": "區分名稱解析故障與連線後的故障",
      "objectiveIds": [
        "boundary"
      ],
      "sectionId": "boundary",
      "sources": [],
      "style": "normal",
      "unitId": "fundamentals.domain-dns",
      "position": 22,
      "remainingSteps": 17,
      "totalSteps": 39
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:scenario",
          "kind": "scenario",
          "label": "情況",
          "text": "DNS 正確，但使用者透過 HTTPS 看到憑證錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:step:0",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步驟 1",
          "text": "使用 dig 檢查名稱和回應。"
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:step:1",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步驟 2",
          "text": "檢查連線目標提供的憑證名稱和有效期限。"
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 18,
      "id": "fundamentals.domain-dns:section:boundary:example:1",
      "kind": "example",
      "label": "範例",
      "objectiveIds": [
        "boundary"
      ],
      "sectionId": "boundary",
      "sources": [],
      "style": "normal",
      "unitId": "fundamentals.domain-dns",
      "position": 23,
      "remainingSteps": 16,
      "totalSteps": 39
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:step:2",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步驟 3",
          "text": "將 HTTP 回應、TLS 與 DNS 分別記錄為監控項目。"
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:outcome",
          "kind": "outcome",
          "label": "結論",
          "text": "不要將 DNS 成功誤認為 TLS 或應用程式成功。"
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 18,
      "id": "fundamentals.domain-dns:section:boundary:example:2",
      "kind": "example",
      "label": "範例",
      "objectiveIds": [
