          "contentRef": "section:boundary:misconception:claim",
          "kind": "misconception",
          "label": "這是錯誤的",
          "text": "如果 Route 53 運作狀態檢查正常，HTTPS 憑證也一定正確。"
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:misconception:correction",
          "kind": "correction",
          "label": "更正",
          "text": "運作狀態檢查的條件與憑證驗證是兩回事。請分別檢查 DNS、TLS 和 HTTP 回應。"
        }
      ],
